# Templates and static UI

## Structure

- Extend `templates/base_dashboard.html` for authenticated role pages; auth flows use `templates/auth/`.
- Shared auth styling: `templates/includes/nexus-auth-styles.html`.
- Prefer Bootstrap 5 / icons from CDN (see README) — match existing markup patterns rather than introducing a new CSS framework.

## Django templates

- Use `{% url 'name' %}` and `{% csrf_token %}` on all POST forms.
- Keep role-specific copy in `patient/`, `doctor/`, `admin/` subtrees; avoid duplicating large nav blocks — use includes or base template blocks.

## Static files

- Theme changes go in `static/css/nexus-theme.css`; run `collectstatic` mindset for production (WhiteNoise serves from collected static).

## Security in templates

- Do not use `|safe` on user-generated or API callback content unless explicitly sanitized server-side.
- Link downloads through existing view routes that enforce ownership, not direct media paths for sensitive reports.
